["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Lyse Doucet Has Learned from 40 Years Reporting From War Zones, Live war of choice chadili agency madrasa\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-iq2-信息从未如此充裕-我们却选择不知道/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/30946a55a23131db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>信息從未如此充裕，我們卻選擇不知道</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Lyse Doucet 做了四十年戰地報道，她的判斷是：不知道不是因為信息不夠，而是因為不想知道。而這場伊朗戰爭是一場選擇之戰，它讓一切變得更糟。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">戰地報道</span><span class=\"tag\">伊朗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Shashank Joshi on Why Russia Won&#x27;t Invade NATO—Yet Article V hybrid warfare Bab-el-Mandeb East-West pipeline\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-goodfight-俄罗斯不会入侵北约-但正在测试它会不会散架/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>俄羅斯不會入侵北約，但正在測試它會不會散架</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">俄羅斯沒有能力發動地面進攻，它的真正目標是腐蝕北約的政治凝聚力——用無人機、包裹炸彈和模糊地帶，逼美國在危機中暴露分歧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span><span class=\"tag\">北約</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Amjad Masad on Rethinking College for the AI Era premature optimization Holacracy self-driving company vibe research virtue ethics\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-a16z-年轻人对社会的用处是当异端-不是当好公民/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>年輕人對社會的用處是當異端，不是當好公民</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大學把年輕人訓練成好公民，但社會真正需要的是他們質疑所有人習以為常的東西；AI 時代每個學生都能自己動手做項目，缺的只是被允許。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育</span><span class=\"tag\">創業時機</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang Thinks A.I. Alarmism Has Gone Too Far inference time scaling retrieval based computing containment agent harness\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-ezra-黄仁勋-说-ai-有-10-概率毁灭人类是不负责任的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:47:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳：說 AI 有 10% 概率毀滅人類是不負責任的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他承認 AI 會改變每一份工作，但把失控風險當成可解的工程問題：如果實驗室真相信自己失控了，正確答案就是別發布產品，而不是一邊買最多算力一邊請求被減速。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>14</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 監管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Has the UK’s productivity puzzle been solved? ONS productivity puzzle leaving certificate loudness wars\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-moreorless-英国生产率危机是统计错误-0-7-被改成-1-3/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">29:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>英國生產率危機是統計錯誤：0.7% 被改成 1.3%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英國被當成發達國家生產率最差生的十五年，可能只是 ONS 算錯了工時——把度假的人按 40 小時算進去，分母虛高，生產率被壓低。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英國經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">生產率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why are used cars priced like new cars? price waterfall APR MSRP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-indicator-二手车为什么卖出了新车的价格/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">9:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Indicator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>二手車為什麼賣出了新車的價格</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">新車漲價會通過「價格瀑布」把二手車一起拖上去，疫情減產讓車市像蛇吞老鼠一樣消化了好幾年，而美國車企乾脆停產了便宜轎車——10 到 15 千美元能買到的車，車齡從 5 年變成了 9 年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車市場</span><span class=\"tag\">通脹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is our national debt finally too much? (update) deficit hawk / deficit dove crowding out debt to GDP ratio Treasury bonds\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-planetmoney-美国债务破-40-万亿-连鸽派都改口当鹰派了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">29:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Planet Money</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>美國債務破 40 萬億：連鴿派都改口當鷹派了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2010 年那篇說債務超 GDP 90% 增長就減半的論文，被政客當成紅線用了十幾年；如今連當年主張大膽花錢的鴿派經濟學家都改口自稱鷹派，但沒人能說出那條線在哪。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宏觀經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">美國國債</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Hidden Recession Beneath The AI Bubble w/ Paul Kedrosky balance sheet recession Minsky moment AMT hurdle rate EBBT token maxing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-betteroffline-ai-债务正在和美元抢钱-美国经济其实在通缩/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd2855e350ec8287-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">54:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Better Offline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>AI 債務正在和美元搶錢，美國經濟其實在通縮</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 資本開支已經大到擠進美債市場、扭曲全球貿易和通脹數據；把 AI 相關部分剔掉，美國經濟其實是輕微通縮，而美聯儲正在照著錯誤的原因加息。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 資本開支</span><span class=\"tag\">美債</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Steve Hilton &amp; Spencer Pratt: Fixing California, Cheaper Gas, Ballot Fraud &amp; CA Republicans ballot harvesting resource curse cap and invest low carbon fuel standard mass tort\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-allin-硅谷太赚钱-反而让加州政府没有变好的动力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/31e8abb9605670fc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">55:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>硅谷太賺錢，反而讓加州政府沒有變好的動力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加州一黨獨大 16 年，不是因為選民想要大政府，而是硅谷上繳的稅收太豐厚，政府不需要靠政績生存。州長候選人 Steve Hilton 說，代價是貧窮率、失業率和生活成本全美最高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國政治</span><span class=\"tag\">加州</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"89.當 AI 進入組織，那些「從沒人說過的真相」｜與網易阮良聊 AI 原生組織與企業 Agent 實戰 Vibe Coding Agent Skills OPC 魯棒性\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-lightstar-个人提效三倍-公司交付只从20天缩到17天/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1386f347b8716dd0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"衛\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">漫談Light the Star</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>個人提效三倍，公司交付只從20天縮到17天</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI武裝了每個人，組織卻沒變快——因為木桶的短板不是人，是流程。真正的分水嶺是能不能改造流程和組織，而不是給員工發token。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI原生組織</span><span class=\"tag\">企業Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"240. 月餅一年只賣兩個月，為什麼還能做成282億的生意？ GB19855 mini package OEM 桃山皮\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-beiwanglu-月饼一年只卖两个月-却做成了282亿的生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c56ff7e702000290-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"貝\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">貝望錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>月餅一年只賣兩個月，卻做成了282億的生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">月餅被中秋綁定後反而困住了銷售期，但282億的規模靠的是送禮場景和柔性定製產線，不是靠口味創新。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品行業</span><span class=\"tag\">消費</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"🔬 An Oscar, Two Asteroids, and the Algorithm in Your sklearn: John Platt on AI for Science ERA Monte Carlo Tree Search upper confidence bound contrail NISQ broom sensor\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-latentspace-ai-做科学卡在最后-0-001-分-不是卡在算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3960561d47aff299-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">2:01:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>AI 做科學卡在最後 0.001 分，不是卡在算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ERA 能跑出成千上萬個候選 notebook，卻關不上最後 30 名的差距——因為內層是機器，外層還得靠人判斷「這篇論文你搞錯了」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for science</span><span class=\"tag\">氣候建模</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Julian Gewirtz on Trump-Xi Summit, AI, and Mao Dead Fifty Years Ago! K-shaped open weight models Memcon peak China\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-chinatalk-特朗普请习近平看戏-美国换到了什么实质东西/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d08a480527461540-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普請習近平看戲，美國換到了什麼實質東西</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這場國事訪問幾乎沒有實質議程，純粹是象徵與鏡頭。問題不是會不會出岔子，而是美國拿象徵換到了什麼實質——目前看，什麼都沒換。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美關係</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 監管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside Canada&#x27;s EU Courtship associate member Erasmus NAFTA price discovery\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-wsjournal-加拿大想加入欧盟-这是对美国的永久分手-不是等特朗普下台/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc66680f65b8e859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>加拿大想加入歐盟：這是對美國的永久分手，不是等特朗普下臺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加拿大要當歐盟第一個「準成員」，但歐盟根本沒有這個身份。這是一次押注歐洲、疏遠美國的世代級轉向，而歐洲經濟增速只有美國的一半。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地緣經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">加拿大</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Episode 341: Psychology Ranked (With Paul Bloom) replication crisis false belief task theory of mind social priming precognition construct\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-verybad-心理学经典实验排等级-很多结论撑不过复现/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de9fabd2316045b0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Very Bad Wizards</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>心理學經典實驗排等級，很多結論撐不過復現</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">米爾格拉姆電擊實驗還能復現，這本身就夠離譜；而好撒瑪利亞人實驗總共只有 40 個受試者，就算他們對了也是碰巧對的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理學</span><span class=\"tag\">復現危機</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside the &#x27;modern slavery&#x27; where cyber scammers are victims themselves pig butchering Tether Volt Typhoon industrial control systems\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-freshair-杀猪盘里没有赢家-骗人的人也是被贩卖的奴隶/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac302fa97b80aab2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">46:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Fresh Air</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>殺豬盤裡沒有贏家：騙人的人也是被販賣的奴隸</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">東南亞詐騙園區裡，被沒收護照、按業績罰款的「員工」每天用 ChatGPT 和 DeepSeek 寫情話，騙走受害者的全部積蓄——這是史上最賺錢的網絡犯罪，受害者站在兩邊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡詐騙</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 濫用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Carlo Rovelli: Free Will Is Real. Physics Can Prove It. coarse graining loop quantum gravity relational quantum mechanics Josephson junction equivalence principle\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-intotheimpossi-熵增不等于变乱-油水分层-霜花结晶都是自发的秩序/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dfac8bb59ae9df0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Into the Impossible With Brian Keating</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>熵增不等於變亂：油水分層、霜花結晶都是自發的秩序</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">熱力學第二定律常被講成「東西會越來越亂」，但油水分離、沙灘分選、窗上霜花都是自發有序。Carlo Rovelli 說，低熵也許不在宇宙，而在我們看宇宙的方式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子引力</span><span class=\"tag\">熵與時間</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Blake Scholl: Why Plane Speed Stalled, Supersonic Commercial Flight, &amp; Revolutionizing the Engine boomless cruise Mach cutoff behind the meter return on net assets\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-allin-超音速客机没落五十年-卡在发动机不在空气动力学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/27508ce5ab7e7d59-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">17:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>超音速客機沒落五十年，卡在發動機不在空氣動力學</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">協和式被禁不是因為技術不行，是音爆砸到地面；Boom 用大氣折射把音爆拐上天，禁令就沒了。真正卡住超音速半個世紀的是發動機，而它現在先拿去給數據中心發電。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">超音速</span><span class=\"tag\">航空</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Rebranding in a war zone, with Prosper Global (formerly Mercy Corps) From Hormuz to Hunger Gaza Sky Geeks USAID\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-masterscale-慈善机构改名-为什么比企业改名更危险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a46e1455d559a76a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">26:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters of Scale</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>慈善機構改名，為什麼比企業改名更危險</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Mercy Corps 改名 Prosper Global，不是因為戰略變了，而是舊名字裝不下它已經在做的事——但改名在衝突地區可能讓員工更危險。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人道援助</span><span class=\"tag\">品牌重塑</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The connection crisis: Why kids are struggling with friendship and what parents can do with Dr. Niobe Way social health antisocial culture crisis of connection relational intelligence metacognition\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-secureattach-青少年友谊崩溃-不是依恋出了问题-而是文化不奖励关怀/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>青少年友誼崩潰，不是依戀出了問題，而是文化不獎勵關懷</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">四十年追蹤發現，安全依戀只是保護因素：活在把成績和競爭看得比關懷更重的文化裡，再安全的依戀也救不了青春期的連接危機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依戀理論</span><span class=\"tag\">青少年友誼</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Gabe Stengel - Building Investing Superintelligence - [Invest Like the Best, EP.492] harness MNPI IC memo DDQ CIM compaction\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-ilt-ai-时代最值钱的不是智能-是审计轨迹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/43ac9b62bb7e7549-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代最值錢的不是智能，是審計軌跡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Rogo 創始人 Gabe Stengel 說，模型已經比任何他認識的人都聰明，剩下的全是管道工程——誰把管道鋪進銀行的合規和系統記錄裡，誰就贏。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">垂直 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">企業銷售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rocky Statue deliberate monument unintentional monument Monument Lab slobs versus snobs\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-ninepi-洛奇雕像不是艺术品-却成了费城拆不掉的地标/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e11e283634cdaaa8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">32:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>洛奇雕像不是藝術品，卻成了費城拆不掉的地標</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一尊為電影造的銅像，被藝術委員會否決、被搬去體育館、在倉庫裡躺過，最後靠的不是藝術價值，而是費城人認它——雕像的地位從來是觀眾給的，不是專家給的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共藝術</span><span class=\"tag\">城市史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ep 222 Vitamin K: Calling the shots vitamin K deficiency bleeding intramuscular injection kernicterus menaquinones phylloquinone GLA proteins\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-tpwky-维生素-k-注射被拒率翻倍-婴儿脑出血本可避免/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>維生素 K 注射被拒率翻倍，嬰兒腦出血本可避免</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所有新生兒出生時都生理性缺乏維生素 K，一針肌肉注射能把晚期出血風險降到接近零；但美國拒打率從 3% 漲到 5.8%，拒打的嬰兒晚期出血風險高 81 倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共衛生</span><span class=\"tag\">兒科</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"290: How to Prevent Failure to Launch | Dr. Mark McConville failure to launch motivational interviewing executive functioning\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-asklisa-逼二十岁的孩子照你的心意长大-可能是在种下中年危机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/861d9fc293eca5b2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">43:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>逼二十歲的孩子照你的心意長大，可能是在種下中年危機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">臨床心理學家指出：失學、休學的二十來歲子女已經在工作，處境其實好過多數「啃老」家庭；真正決定要不要逼孩子回學校的，從來是孩子自己，不是父母。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年心理</span><span class=\"tag\">親子溝通</span>\n</div></div></a>"]